{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的音乐细节和情绪转折提示不如 Y 细密，尤其缺少 Y 那种随乐句变化逐步展开的感受层次。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，X 左边负责讲清人物正在经历什么，右边提供少量感受锚点，主次分明，尤其在18秒的 S05 等段落，不容易被大量短词分散注意力。X 对人物心理变化的因果交代也更直接，比较容易跟住从害怕暴露心意、逐渐放松、产生期待，到接受不确定性的整条故事线。Y 的优势是音乐细节、身体感受和情绪转折更细腻，部分到时出现的提示尤其有价值，但有些段落感受词过密、意象叠加，细节增加并不总能转化成观众实际接收到的信息。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ede226a-9e17-4c28-84f5-4fcaa2b8ff6d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T043022939917Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.437, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:31:13.374310+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7b86aff04f7dfa211fb6848b0d864845465136b15574e44dbbf595f6ae3a3057", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f68